codelaw-data-browsers / @codelaw/data-browsers — codelaw's own browser-support table.

Every row is written by codelaw's maintainers from a browser vendor's own
release notes, feature-status entry or bug tracker, or from the
specification; each row lists those sources under "sources". Nothing is
copied from caniuse (CC-BY-4.0) or from MDN's browser-compat-data (CC0),
which codelaw does not use (L2).

A browser a row leaves out is one no source has confirmed yet: a fix that
needs it stays a suggestion.

